# Build output — NEVER commit these.
#
# Committed binaries caused a real incident on 2026-08-11: a tester downloaded the
# branch source zip from GitHub, ran the STALE bin/Release/QuickfloraPrinting.exe
# still sitting in it (the 2020 baseline), and correctly reported that neither new
# feature worked — because the exe predated them by six years.
#
# Builds are produced from source and published as GitHub Releases. Never from a
# source zip.
QuickfloraPrinting/bin/
QuickfloraPrinting/obj/
bin/
obj/

# Visual Studio local state
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
